- @title = 'Flatiron · Nitrous'
- @html_class = 'light'
- @body_id = 'flatiron'
- @body_class = 'story'

.page
  .page-hero
    .container
      = render partial: 'layouts/webnav', locals: { active: 'flatiron' }
      .hero-copy
        h2
          | Flatiron + Nitrous
        h3
          | Learn how the Flatiron School in NYC is using Nitrous
    
  
  article.featurette.offset-visual.centered
    .container
      
      .full-visual data-for-video="1"
        #hero-video.video-wrapper data-video="1"
          iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/134506627" frameborder="0" webkitallowfullscreen mozallowfullscreen allowfullscreen
          
      p.big
        ' Flatiron uses Nitrous Pro as the cloud-coding platform in its Pre-College Academy courses, designed to train students to be professional software developers.
        strong Nitrous removes administrative and IT burdens
        | , so that teachers and instructors can focus on providing the best quality of education and meeting specific students' needs 
      
      p.big
        ' The key to Flatiron's selection of Nitrous is the
        strong collaboration features
        |  that allow instructors and students to work Google-docs style on the same code in real-time. Using Nitrous, students can request coaching from both the local instructor and other Flatiron instructors who are remote, solving problems together and amongst the class using pair-programming techniques.
      
      a.btn.blue.submit href="/education-pricing" Register Your Interest

  article.quotes.colored.nitrous
    .container
      .box-wrapper.one
        blockquote
          p
            | Nitrous allows Flatiron's students to have the flexibility of using any device — Windows, Mac, Linux or Chromebook — and begin coding from day one.
          cite
            | Avi Flombaum
            span , Dean &amp; Co-founder, The Flatiron School


  article.featurette.side-by-side
    .container
    
      .full-visual data-for-video="2"
        .video-wrapper data-video="2"
          iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/134121453" frameborder="0" webkitallowfullscreen mozallowfullscreen allowfullscreen
      
      p
        | Using the Nitrous API platform, the Flatiron School is able to set up coding environments for thousands of students on a variety of devices all from their own "Learn" platform. 
        br
        br
        | The provisioning of coding environments integrates students into the onboarding process, so that teachers can focus on students instead of machines. Students select the course from the Learn platform, click on the Nitrous button and are instantly placed into the Nitrous coding environment.


  article.cta.darker
    .container
      h3.section-title Register your interest, get group pricing plans
      h4
        | Learn and build software using our Web IDE, Chrome app, or your favorite Desktop editor.
        br
        | Share workspaces, and code collaboratively in the classroom.
      a.btn.blue.submit href="/education-pricing" Register Your Course


= render partial: 'layouts/footer', locals: { active: 'flatiron' }
